isplay site has one way to turn a stored timestamp (aware-UTC ISO, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]naive ISO, or epoch) into an aware configured-tz value, plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]divergence-fixture unit tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Artifacts tab and artifact CLI[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]artifacts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after helpers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifacts: fix the Files/Beads/Plans panes, the artifact-ref completion [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]menu, and `sase artifact list` so artifact and bead timestamps render in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the configured timezone instead of raw UTC.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ACE modals, tools panel, and file panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui-panels[dim] · [dim][/dim]after helpers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui-panels: fix the logs, statistics, project-inventory, tasks, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]saved-group, and roster displays plus the tools and file panel fetch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]clocks, which currently show UTC or the host system clock.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]CLI tables, generated Markdown pages, and telemetry defaults[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-pages[dim] · [dim][/dim]after helpers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-pages: fix `sase task`, `sase repo log`, `sase memory log`, `sase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]skills log`, the agents-sync and bead-page Markdown renderers, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory review TUI, notification-gate debug dumps, and the telemetry [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render tz defaults.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Artifact-file calendar dates in the configured timezone[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]artifact-dates[dim] · [dim][/dim]after helpers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifact-dates: mint artifact `created_at` and the retention `now` with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the configured-tz offset and make the Rust core bucket calendar dates by[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that embedded offset, so `date:`/`since:` filtering agrees with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]displayed day.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Repo-wide guard test and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]guard-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after helpers, artifacts, tui-panels, cli-pages, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]artifact-dates[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]guard-docs: add an allowlisted AST guard that fails on new system-clock [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and UTC-display patterns under `src/`, document the display convention, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and run the full check suite.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-em","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","phase_bead_id":"sase-em.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-4c5506bf36d08114f93fa9e42ecdfb6a","started_at":"2026-08-03T12:01:58.496799+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785765008,"sha":"c449ce27cf0cd18b0f5a78f80f8742963a7c97f3","subject":"fix: render timestamps in configured timezone"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"d368e14eb4be04f98bb4fb83891b9cdd259f16ccb03adf5d752c6c0576a5681a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-em.4/chat.md","size_bytes":12275},"commits":{"digest":"015fc923a8e20a2b77e04fe1af117fa6eb63f6427433a477057ac464e69323a5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-em.4/commits.json","size_bytes":223},"embedded_workflows":{"